NAME
       rm - remove files or directories

SYNOPSIS
       rm [OPTION]... FILE...

DESCRIPTION
       Remove each FILE. By default directories are not removed. rm refuses to
       remove ., .. and /.

OPTIONS
       -r, -R, --recursive
           remove directories and their contents recursively

       -d
           remove empty directories

       -f, --force
           ignore nonexistent files, never prompt

       -i
           prompt before every removal

       -v
           explain what is being done

EXAMPLES
       rm old.log
       rm -rf /root/build

SEE ALSO
       rmdir(1), mv(1)
